                    Statement, possibly written by <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS9683Urbino">Giusto da Urbino</persName> himself.
                  </desc>
                  <q xml:lang="gez">
                    ይቤ፡ አባ፡ ዮስጦስ፡ <lb/> እምአርክ፡ <choice><corr resp="bm:GrebTiss1935Codices">ዘኣፈቅሮ፡</corr><sic>ዘታፈቅሮ፡</sic></choice> 
                    ኢትፍ<add place="above">ል</add>ጠ<supplied reason="lost">ኒ</supplied>፡ <lb/> ያዕቆብ፡ ለእንተ፡ አሐዱ፡ ተብህለ፡ <lb/> እስመ፡ የአክል፡ ለክልኤ። <lb/> 
